HOW TO IDENTIFY WHICH TYPE — DECISION GUIDE
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Read the problem. Ask these questions in order:

Does it ask about cycles, middle node, or palindrome?
→ YES → Type 1 (Fast & Slow Pointers)

Does it ask to reverse the list, a sublist, or in k-groups?
→ YES → Type 2 (Reversal)

Does it ask to merge sorted lists, remove nth from end,
or find intersection?
→ YES → Type 3 (Two Pointer / Merge)

Does it ask to reorder, rearrange, partition, or deep copy?
→ YES → Type 4 (Node Rearrangement)

Also ask: might I insert or delete at the head?
→ YES → use a dummy node.

