Cycle, middle, palindrome → Fast & Slow Pointers
Reverse full / partial → Iterative reversal (3 pointers)
Merge sorted lists → Two pointers + dummy head
Nth node from end → Two pointers, n+1 gap
Intersection of two lists → Swap heads to equalize path length
Reorder / rearrange → Split + reverse second half + merge
Deep copy with random ptr → Hashmap (original → clone)
